# Tells GitHub Pages not to run Jekyll over this site.
#
# Jekyll drops every path whose name starts with "_", and the page's Python
# imports two packages by their __init__.py (data/skillparse/fs/skillparseumr/src/):
# a 404 there stops Python from booting while the page still draws. See
# test/repository-integrity.test.mjs and scripts/check-deploy.mjs.
